== Solution ==
<!-- 
PP1V8_AWAKE shorted to ground due to liquid damage around C4522, C4526, C4523, C4535. Note C4526 is a 9.1uF feed through capacitor (Murata NFM15PC915D0E3D if you need to order). Commonly used cap on boards like 820-1700. Also replaced C4411 on the PP0V9_SLPDDR next to it; this rail measures pretty low at 35 ohms and is normal. May vary depending on board temp. Careful in this area as the T2 is on the opposite side of the board. I used low melt and an iron to get these caps off rather than stress the board too much. 

-->



